<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Retail sales data backs growth view-Canberra.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Retail sales data backs growth view-Canberra.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acting Australian Treasurer Jim Short said on Tuesday that retail sales figures supported the government's forecasts of solid economic growth for 1996/97.</p>
<p>&quot;August retail trade figures ... are encouraging and support the budget's forecast of solid economic growth for 1997/97,&quot; Short said in a statement.</p>
<p>Short also repeated government claims its budget would bring about lower interest rates and increase employment.</p>
</text>
